      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹10.01 (vs ₹5.01 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹10.01 (up from ₹5.01 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹468.4m (down 11% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹71.0m (up 100% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (up from 6.8% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 8% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 9% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
